    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>“The edge hums when you lie, you know.”</em></p><p><strong>Sanctified.</strong> This weapon deals <strong>radiant</strong> damage.</p><p><strong>Mercy Finish.</strong> If a creature is reduced to 0 Integrity by this weapon’s damage, it falls <strong>unconscious and stable</strong> instead of dying. If it is Qliphothified/Corrupted/Darkness-bound, that state is suppressed; the GM may describe the target “coming back to themselves.”</p><p><strong>Playtest safety:</strong> This item is designed to avoid faction-level knock-on effects.</p>",
